<div class="px-4 py-3 rounded mb-4 bg-gray-100 border border-gray-400 text-gray-700 flex relative" role="alert" data-controller="alert">
  <i class="fa fa-info-circle me-2 fa-2x"></i>
  <div>
    <p>
      <strong>
        Welcome to the Word Roots, Stems and Lemmas Tool!
      </strong>
    </p>

    <p>
      A word linked to the wrong root, stem or lemma, or missing one? Fix it on its ayah, in <strong>Ayahs</strong>.
      A root, stem or lemma with a wrong spelling, or a wrong or missing meaning? Fix it in <strong>Roots</strong>, <strong>Stems</strong> or <strong>Lemmas</strong>.
      Your suggestion is saved as a draft, and goes live once a reviewer approves it.
    </p>

    <% unless user_signed_in? %>
      <p>
        <%= link_to 'Sign in to suggest a fix', new_user_session_path, class: 'btn btn-dark' %>
      </p>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
